About WPP Media

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships - all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open - we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. 

WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.

For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

1. Descrição da vaga

Estamos em busca de uma Pessoa Analista de Mídia Sênior para integrar nossa equipe de Mídia e atuar com grandes clientes do setor financeiro e de meios de pagamento!

Procuramos um profissional com forte perfil analítico e estratégico, com foco em performance, análise profunda de dados e gestão de um alto volume de campanhas cooperadas (majoritariamente digitais).

2. Responsabilidades e atribuições

• Liderar a implementação estratégica, otimização avançada e o acompanhamento de pacing de um alto volume de campanhas.

• Analisar dados complexos de campanhas de performance, extraindo insights estratégicos para melhoria contínua e tomada de decisão.

• Construir relatórios detalhados e conduzir apresentações de resultados de alto nível diretamente para os clientes.

• Gerenciar o faturamento e as rotinas financeiras de maior complexidade utilizando a ferramenta VBS.

• Atuar de forma colaborativa e propositiva, dividindo a gestão das campanhas e auxiliando no desenvolvimento técnico do time de mídia.

3. Requisitos e qualificações

• Experiência prática, sólida e avançada em performance, implementação e análise de dados de campanhas.

• Domínio/conhecimento prático avançado na ferramenta de faturamento VBS.

• Amplo conhecimento e vivência nas plataformas essenciais: Meta Ads, Google Ads e TikTok.

• Capacidade analítica aguçada para análise de dados, construção de relatórios gerenciais e interpretação de indicadores de desempenho.

4. Diferenciais

• Vivência em agências de publicidade;

• Experiência em planejamento e compra de mídia On/Off;

5. Benefícios

• Plano Médico e Odontológico SulAmerica;

• Vale Refeição ou Vale Alimentação;

• Seguro de Vida;

• TotalPass;

• Day Off de aniversário;

• Auxílio Home Office;

• Licenças maternidade e paternidade estendidas;

• Desconto em farmácias;

• EAP (Programa de Assistência ao Empregado);

• E muitas oportunidades de crescimento!

6. Mais detalhes:

• Modelo de contratação CLT;

• Modelo de trabalho híbrido;

• Escritório localizado na região da Vila Leopoldina.

Aqui, acreditamos no poder das diferenças. Nosso compromisso com a diversidade está no jeito como enxergamos o mundo, nas relações que cultivamos e nas histórias que queremos construir juntos. Valorizamos perspectivas diversas porque elas enriquecem nosso trabalho, nos desafiam a evoluir e nos tornam mais criativos, humanos e justos. Todas as pessoas são bem-vindas no nosso processo seletivo, independentemente de raça, identidade de gênero, orientação sexual, deficiência, origem ou crença.

Please read our Privacy Notice &nbsp; for more information on how we process the information you provide. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

Lead Solutions Engineer&nbsp;

&nbsp;

The presales mission is to sell better to reduce turn rate and to push for value-driven propositions that solve for customers.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

As a Solutions Engineer, you will partner with the sales organization seamlessly to drive the execution of prospective and expansive deals. You will utilize your technical knowledge to become a trusted partner with sales and services.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

What will your day-to-day look like?&nbsp;

&nbsp;

• Building and maintaining relationships with sales reps, partners, customers and other internal stakeholders

• Gaining knowledge of HubSpot products for better-proposed solutions

• Understanding customer challenges and how to deliver technical value to meet their business goals and objectives

• Participating and directing projects relevant to presales, sales, and the wider business

• Coaching and mentoring less experienced team members

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

What do you need to succeed in this role?

&nbsp;

• Presales, technical consultant/sales role or similar (6+ years)

• Experience working with internal teams and stakeholders and dealing with external customers&nbsp;

• You are open to admitting mistakes and believe that actionable feedback is a great way to learn and grow

• You enjoy collaborating with different teams and are motivated to develop yourself

• You have HEART

&nbsp;

Pay &amp; Benefits

The cash compensation below includes base salary, on-target commission for employees in eligible roles, and annual bonus targets under HubSpot’s bonus plan for eligible roles. In addition to cash compensation, some roles are eligible to participate in HubSpot’s equity plan to receive restricted stock units (RSUs). Individual compensation packages are determined using objective, role-related criteria, which may include skills, experience, qualifications, and other job-related factors.

This resource will help guide how we recommend thinking about the range you see.&nbsp;

Benefits are also an important piece of your total compensation package. Explore the benefits and perks HubSpot offers to help employees grow better.

At HubSpot, fair compensation practices aren’t just about checking off the box for legal compliance. It’s about living out our value of transparency with our employees, candidates, and community.

Annual Cash Compensation Range:
€88.850 &mdash; €127.050 EUR

At HubSpot, we value both flexibility and connection. Whether you’re a Remote employee or work from the Office, we want you to start your journey here by building strong connections with your team and peers. If you are joining our Engineering team, you will be required to attend a regional HubSpot office for in-person onboarding. If you join our broader Product team, you’ll also attend other in-person events, such as your Product Group Summit and other gatherings, to continue building on those connections.

If you require an accommodation due to travel limitations or other reasons, please inform your recruiter during the hiring process. We are committed to supporting candidates who may need alternative arrangements

